What are Retail Loss Prevention Solutions?
Retail loss prevention solutions integrate advanced technologies, operational strategies, and employee training to mitigate shrinkage caused by theft, fraud, and operational errors. These solutions leverage tools such as AI-powered surveillance systems, RFID tagging, predictive analytics, and automated point-of-sale monitoring to enhance asset protection while optimizing profitability. Key components include electronic article surveillance (EAS), access control systems, inventory management platforms, and cybersecurity measures tailored for retail environments.
